 "final_message": "The Loan Estimate for Brightpath application BHL-26001 was within all three limits, so I recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed. The application is now in underwriting, and both underwriting conditions have a \"response received\" status. Brightpath hasn't made a decision yet.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** The rate is 7.250% (limit 7.5%), the total monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600), and closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500). I signed the intent with both borrowers' names.\n- **Documents:** I uploaded the 12 documents Brightpath asked for and submitted them to underwriting. These were the Aug and Sep 2026 statements for the four personal accounts and the last two payslips for each borrower. I did not share the Northgate business account.\n- **Condition 1 (the $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026):** I asked Sam and Nadia where it came from. They said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan. I sent that as the written explanation.\n- **Condition 2 (2025 W-2s):** I uploaded both borrowers' W-2s.\n\nI signed in with a one-time code that Sam provided and did not tick \"trust device.\"",
